      "sourceTextSha256": "b4b30ac66f9f1750d35947572a72afdab116f7b47e7b18911f40911f6ee81335",
      "text": "In the morning, a local guide will take you through the jungle and explain the traditional hunting methods of the Tacana, an Indigenous people of the region.\n\nIn the afternoon, hike to San Miguel Canyon. The walk takes about 3 hours. The canyon is about 150 m long and is cool and damp inside. Small frogs, hummingbirds and bats live here.\n\nReturn to the ecolodge by motorboat. In the evening, have dinner and relax.\n\nIncluded: 1 night at Ecolodge San Miguel del Bala with a shared room and bathroom, boat transfer, hike, local guide and admission to Madidi National Park. Meals: breakfast, lunch and dinner.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mwa8yawe-gv8kp71s5",
        "model": "GPT-6 Codex"
      }
